this is the parva Ali Blanca the bird  that came back from extinction  the pava  Ali Blanca is a slender black bird with  a black tipped peak and nine large white  flight feathers at the end of its wings  it was first discovered in 1877 but  after several research expeditions with  no sightings the Pahlavi Blanca was  declared extinct by the scientific  community then in 1977 the species was  rediscovered in Peru with less than 250  known specimens they are classified as  critically endangered this is the pava  Ali Blanca  [Music]
 

